    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6585" root="جَهِلَ" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْهَلَةٌ</span></b>  (IDrd, JK, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْهَلٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْهَلٌ</span></b> 
(IDrd, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْهَلَةٌ</span></b>  (K) <i>A piece of wood
with which one stirs live,</i> or <i>burning, coals</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمْر</span>),
(JK, K, TA,) or <i>wine</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَمْر</span>); (so in some copies
of the K;) of the dial. of El-Yemen. (TA.)

